
>> shop := (Diksyunaryo bago
	ilagay: ['magazine'] sa: ['books'],
	ilagay: ['computer'] sa: ['electronics'],
	ilagay: ['lipstick'] sa: ['cosmetics']
).
Labas isulat: (shop mayroon: ['computer']), bagong-linya. 
Labas isulat: (shop mayroon: ['sausage']), bagong-linya. 
Labas isulat: (shop mayroon: ['computers']), bagong-linya. 
Labas isulat: (shop mayroon: ['compute']), bagong-linya. 
Labas isulat: (shop mayroon: ['2computer']), bagong-linya. 
